What's hard to say, like, oh, I'm doing so much better by cancers and remissions, so I'm

00:00:24,060 --> 00:00:31,340
going to stop doing the things that got me in remission. That's not always wise things to do. So,

00:00:31,820 --> 00:00:42,380
you know, and years ago, I wouldn't emphasize that very much. Meaning, I wouldn't

